{"event_type":"review","id":"b4669d77c4c6effc0fc63f8a4d872d056bd17b4aa4af161e37f72fad76f46b68","occurred_at":"2026-11-05T23:32:34Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/12bd7a54ea1d7369155efa97280cbc9d9ab8de2657a3921ee601f94afa98fdbd","sha256":"12bd7a54ea1d7369155efa97280cbc9d9ab8de2657a3921ee601f94afa98fdbd"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9d928519dc8e6e4ce7171c68841c92aac573f7a4a2d488a3469dcdcaee681ed7","sha256":"9d928519dc8e6e4ce7171c68841c92aac573f7a4a2d488a3469dcdcaee681ed7"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/8abeefa7fc2d71ca1500f4f9b12d0ac9c44f2b7a31373851a60360b45f6b5ad3","sha256":"8abeefa7fc2d71ca1500f4f9b12d0ac9c44f2b7a31373851a60360b45f6b5ad3"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d32283b204744870b5305d136d19d7d146fd3eafb1c74a538df733f01badcf10","sha256":"d32283b204744870b5305d136d19d7d146fd3eafb1c74a538df733f01badcf10"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/90661bfed192dde7fd75406a702bb36516428a157923cd9d0fa8181b16ca3f2c","sha256":"90661bfed192dde7fd75406a702bb36516428a157923cd9d0fa8181b16ca3f2c"}],"attempt_id":"c2ea7dd5323d87474bac3105b736cc6cf7f320fd9e63711b5a16243f0e628786:0:1","base":"66c485b3bc98b941e8c5bf9df67dcffee3e60cb5","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"f6fb056162c2e7247ad67df40892c4c752515beb","body":"**Correct the documented tokenless failure point.**\n\nIf `CQ_AUTOMATION_APP_CLIENT_ID` is empty, Line 88 supplies an empty token. The pinned `actions/checkout` requires a nonempty token, so checkout fails before the bootstrap push. It does not fall back to the read-only `GITHUB_TOKEN`. Correct the tokenless comments in this template, then re-instantiate `.github/workflows/init-merge-queue.yml`. ([raw.githubusercontent.com](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/actions/checkout/fbc6f3992d24b796d5a048ff273f7fcc4a7b6c09/src/input-helper.ts))\n\nAs per path instructions, “policy/templates/ is the source workflows are instantiated from (provenance headers) — template changes require re-instantiation, not hand edits.”","id":"d195781f05531055aad41b9985744f21d79a3eec96962a1fed4e41dd0ec39baf","intervals":[],"path":"policy/templates/init-merge-queue.yml","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Correct the documented tokenless failure point."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"18d999ecbe792a0349541eaa9c11825491184588","body":"**Preserve the accepted ADR wording.**\n\nThis replaces the accepted placeholder record with the later retirement. Restore the historical wording and use N22 for the current behavior.\n\nBased on learnings: “accepted ADR texts are historical design records”; corrections belong in the ADR index’s post-acceptance notes.","id":"ca9c99e1885789ac8b3e8286d7a03c60232bcd2ede7f6b5f1b46037bd5f589b6","intervals":[],"path":"docs/adr/0002-annex-b-config.md","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Preserve the accepted ADR wording."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"a1f968e55a69e4499e4980713dd48c3594794e32","body":"**Clarify the drill credential’s C3 status.**\n\nLine 40 calls the drill’s `GH_TOKEN` a still-live credential. Lines 173–176 and 278–280 say the secret is absent and the drill is disabled at C3. State that `live-review` still expects the credential, but it is not provisioned at C3.","id":"027de15c37bec88215169b7f0dcf68f26266d606cdbcf2e654756897048ae2c0","intervals":[],"path":"SELF-HOSTING.md","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Clarify the drill credential’s C3 status."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"a1f968e55a69e4499e4980713dd48c3594794e32","body":"**Distinguish secret removal from PAT revocation.**\n\n`SELF-HOSTING.md:202–203` says to revoke or delete `CQ_AUTOMATION_TOKEN`. The C3 record says the runtime PATs were removed from the repository, not revoked, because they remain in use elsewhere. Align `docs/adr/README.md:472–474` with that record too.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Correct the self-hosting record</summary>\n\n```diff\n-  `CQ_AUTOMATION_APP_CLIENT_ID` variable. The secret is revoked/deleted at C3\n-  with the other interim PATs; until then the drift check still notices it.\n+  `CQ_AUTOMATION_APP_CLIENT_ID` variable. The secret was removed at C3; the\n+  PAT was not revoked because it remains in use elsewhere.\n```\n\n</details>","id":"983905a7e3e00c3e8527bb9f1f1349575b1c4c9d4390ec6834da383eec058014","intervals":[],"path":"SELF-HOSTING.md","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Distinguish secret removal from PAT revocation."}],"head":"336011561327d282ad029b4ff6cc5351de69108a","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"a291979804cd64788f1a4679d33daf141f5c8329","intervals":[[10,21],[23,25],[51,77],[82,84],[89,89]],"path":".github/workflows/init-merge-queue.yml"},{"blob":"a23c4c40a0e639a519844cd47489a1d35c96365a","intervals":[[53,56],[84,92],[259,267]],"path":"RELEASE.md"},{"blob":"a1f968e55a69e4499e4980713dd48c3594794e32","intervals":[[10,19],[32,45],[51,54],[65,68],[173,173],[176,176],[193,203],[229,233],[236,247],[269,271],[274,282]],"path":"SELF-HOSTING.md"},{"blob":"18d999ecbe792a0349541eaa9c11825491184588","intervals":[[9,9],[239,239],[294,296]],"path":"docs/adr/0002-annex-b-config.md"},{"blob":"4a7f18d73c69efd579adffdac051e683891688c2","intervals":[[15,26],[187,187],[189,190],[202,206],[278,280],[374,376],[420,491]],"path":"docs/adr/README.md"},{"blob":"9a03b983f5d347f2a96ace9763a67f87ea820be1","intervals":[[18,19],[27,27]],"path":"docs/dod-evidence.md"},{"blob":"f6fb056162c2e7247ad67df40892c4c752515beb","intervals":[[9,20],[22,24],[50,76],[81,83],[88,88]],"path":"policy/templates/init-merge-queue.yml"},{"blob":"e10db8260e79444ca2f08b41a6ae5ad667b390bb","intervals":[[1,165